      "label": "Appointed as Squad Leader",
      "category": "Battle",
      "english": "I'm the Captain...? O-Okay! If that's your wish, Doctor!...",
      "japanese": "た、隊長がぼく……？あの、えっと、ドクターがそうおっしゃるなら……！",
      "audioPath": "char_253_greyy/CN_018.mp3"
