    {
      "fileCode": "CN_038",
      "label": "New Year's blessing",
      "category": "Talk",
      "english": "Happy New Year, Doctor! There's too much excess and zero majesty to playing songs on Monster Siren hi-fis and related devices! Allow me to use a hotter, more direct method to boost the vigor of this fireworks show! BANG!! Pewwwwww... BANG!!!",
      "japanese": "ハッピーニューイヤー！ドクター様、セイレーン製のスピーカーで曲を流す程度では雰囲気が出ませんので、ここは私が熱く、ダイレクトに、花火大会を彩って見せましょう！ポーン！ヒューーポンポーン！",
      "audioPath": "char_376_therex/CN_038.mp3"
    },
    {
      "fileCode": "CN_042",
      "label": "Greeting",
      "category": "Greeting",
      "english": "Welcome back, Doctor! I see that you're also full of light and heat today!",
      "japanese": "お帰りなさいませ、ドクター様！今日も光とエネルギーに満ち溢れてらっしゃるようですね！",
      "audioPath": "char_376_therex/CN_042.mp3"
    },
    {
      "fileCode": "CN_043",
      "label": "Birthday",
      "category": "Talk",
      "english": "I hear the others are expressing their feelings of fondness for you by way of gifts, but you and I have no need for such tedious things to express our emotions! Our hearts have long been connected through heat and impact! Doctor! Happy birthday!",
      "japanese": "本日はドクター様にプレゼントを贈ることで、好意を伝える一日と聞きました。しかし私とドクター様の関係であれば、そんなややこしいもので気持ちを表現する必要はないと思います！私たちの心はとうの昔に熱エネルギーとショックパワーで一つになっているのですから！ハッピーバースデー、ドクター様！",
      "audioPath": null
    },
    {
      "fileCode": "CN_044",
      "label": "Anniversary Celebration",
      "category": "Talk",
      "english": "Doctor!! Even I'm dazzled by the liveliness of this spectacle! Hesitate no more, come with me! Let us celebrate with the others!",
      "japanese": "ドクター様！！このように熱い光景は、この私ですら、眩く感じます！さあ、迷いを捨てて私についてきてください。皆と共に熱く祝いましょう！",
      "audioPath": "char_376_therex/CN_044.mp3"
    }
